<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Radius UI - Ideology : English source of truth for every C# facing string.
  House style (GLOBAL_RULES §7):
    - Vanilla sentence case. Only the first word is capitalized, plus proper nouns.
    - No em dash and no en dash anywhere. Use a spaced hyphen, a comma or a full stop.
    - Second person, present tense, concrete.
  Def labels and descriptions are NOT here; those are DefInjected. This mod ships no defs.
-->
